  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raising the value of biodiversity-friendly cocoa and carbon storage: ensuring sustainable incomes around Gola Rainforest National Park</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We propose to produce a methodologically transparent and continuously updated decision-support tool to support the notfor-profit company, Gola Rainforest Conservation Limited Group (GRC-LG) in Sierra Leone, which has identified a need to be able to audit</narrative>
  </description>
